@api = http://localhost:5100

### 1. Kiem tra server -> 200
GET {{api}}/

### 2. Danh sach -> 200 (3 san pham khi vua khoi dong)
GET {{api}}/api/products

### 3. Chi tiet -> 200
GET {{api}}/api/products/1

### 4. Khong ton tai -> 404 + ApiError
GET {{api}}/api/products/999

### 5. Sai kieu route -> 404, body rong
GET {{api}}/api/products/abc

### 6. Tao hop le -> 201 + Location
POST {{api}}/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Lap trinh gRPC", "description": "Tai lieu bai 5", "price": 80000 }

### 7. Gia am -> 400 + INVALID_PRODUCT
POST {{api}}/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "San pham loi", "description": "", "price": -1 }

### 8. Sai Content-Type -> 415 (curl thieu -H cung gui kieu nay)
POST {{api}}/api/products
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

{ "name": "Lap trinh gRPC", "description": "Tai lieu bai 5", "price": 80000 }
